---
// FAQ.astro
---

<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="faq-container">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="faq-header">
      <span class="faq-badge">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>
      <h2 class="faq-title">Common Technical & Operational Queries</h2>
      <p class="faq-subtitle">Get clear answers regarding our workshop capabilities, on-site diagnostics, and emergency response pipelines.</p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Questions Container -->
    <div class="faq-list">
      
      <!-- Question 1 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">What is your standard turnaround time for emergency motor rewinds?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>While repair times depend on motor frame size and extent of damage, our 24/7 workshop pipelines are optimized for rapid-turnaround emergency overhauls to keep downtime minimal.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 2 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Do you offer on-site fault-finding or must equipment be brought to Krugersdorp?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We provide both. Field teams deploy nationwide for diagnostics and on-site testing, while major mechanical overhauls are routed directly to our Krugersdorp facility.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 3 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Do you handle high-voltage transformer maintenance and oil testing?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes. We offer comprehensive transformer services including dissolved gas analysis (DGA), oil purification/filtration, bushing replacements, and full thermal imaging diagnostics.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 4 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Are your engineering repairs and testing protocols ISO 9001 aligned?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes. All diagnostic reports, insulation testing, dynamic balancing, and mechanical overhauls strictly adhere to ISO 9001 quality standards and engineering specifications.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 5 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">How quickly can emergency breakdown teams deploy to site?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Our emergency response crews operate 24/7 and are primed for rapid dispatch across South Africa to minimize unexpected plant downtime during critical failures.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 6 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">What condition monitoring services do you provide to prevent unexpected failures?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We perform routine vibration analysis, thermographic inspection, insulation resistance (Megger) testing, and surge testing to detect early warning signs before total failure occurs.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 7 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">Can your team overhaul industrial generators and HV switchgear?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Absolutely. We specialize in complete maintenance, breaker testing, busbar refurbishments, and stator/rotor rewinding for industrial diesel generators and high-voltage switchgear.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 8 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span class="question-text">What types of industries do you service for electrical overhauls?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We service a wide spectrum of heavy industries, including mining and minerals processing, power generation, heavy manufacturing, municipal utilities, commercial complexes, and petrochemical plants.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Base Section Styling */
  .faq-section {
    background-color: #222222;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .faq-container {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Header Centering */
  .faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .faq-badge {
    color: #FF7F00;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .faq-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .faq-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .faq-subtitle {
    color: #a3a3a3;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* FAQ List */
  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  /* Individual Card Box */
  .faq-item {
    background-color: #2d2d2d;
    border: 1px solid #3d3d3d;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  /* SELECTED / OPEN STATE: Thin Orange Surround Border */
  .faq-item[open] {
    border: 1px solid #FF7F00 !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.15);
  }

  /* Question Header Row */
  .faq-question {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    user-select: none;
    list-style: none;
  }

  /* Remove default browser arrow markers */
  .faq-question::-webkit-details-marker,
  .faq-question::marker {
    display: none !important;
    content: "";
  }

  /* Question Text - Centre Aligned */
  .question-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .question-text {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
  }

  /* Active Question Text Highlight */
  .faq-item[open] .question-text {
    color: #FF7F00;
  }

  /* Orange Plus Icon */
  .faq-icon {
    color: #FF7F00;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease-in-out;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Rotate icon into an 'X' when open */
  .faq-item[open] .faq-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* Answer Body - Centre Aligned */
  .faq-answer {
    padding: 0 24px 22px 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .faq-answer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #d1d5db;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>